00:07:46.766 --> 00:07:48.768
now, calling on the attorney general

00:07:48.768 --> 00:07:50.503
to unseal the indictment.

00:07:50.503 --> 00:07:51.204
Let's listen to this

00:07:53.339 --> 00:07:53.606
Justice

00:07:53.606 --> 00:07:54.240
Department, I

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.642
think, before the sun sets today.

00:07:56.642 --> 00:07:58.177
The attorney general of the United States

00:07:58.177 --> 00:07:59.078
should be standing

00:07:59.078 --> 00:08:00.046
in front of the American

00:08:00.046 --> 00:08:02.215
people, should unseal this indictment.

00:08:02.582 --> 00:08:04.083
Should provide the American people

00:08:04.083 --> 00:08:04.951
with all the facts

00:08:04.951 --> 00:08:06.152
and information here

00:08:06.152 --> 00:08:08.020
and the American people

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:09.889
to be able to judge for themselves

00:08:09.889 --> 00:08:11.958
whether this is just the latest incident

00:08:11.958 --> 00:08:13.326
of weaponization

00:08:13.326 --> 00:08:14.460
and politicization

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:15.561
of the Justice Department

00:08:15.561 --> 00:08:17.897
or if it's something different

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.332
or if it's something different.

00:08:19.332 --> 00:08:19.966
What do you think of what

00:08:19.966 --> 00:08:21.300
Pence is saying there?

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.401
I do think he's correct

00:08:22.401 --> 00:08:24.437
that given the political sensitivities

00:08:24.437 --> 00:08:24.770
of this

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:25.371
case,

00:08:25.371 --> 00:08:26.706
transparency is going to be

00:08:26.706 --> 00:08:28.608
of the utmost importance

00:08:28.608 --> 00:08:30.476
for the court of public opinion,

00:08:30.476 --> 00:08:32.078
because the people need to know

00:08:32.078 --> 00:08:33.513
what is in this indictment

00:08:33.513 --> 00:08:34.780
in order to make a judgment.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:35.581
And that's why

00:08:35.581 --> 00:08:36.782
I think that the Republicans

00:08:36.782 --> 00:08:37.950
like Kevin McCarthy

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:40.119
or some of the other 20, 24

00:08:40.119 --> 00:08:41.387
rivals for Trump,

00:08:41.387 --> 00:08:42.255
that have rushed to

00:08:42.255 --> 00:08:42.889
his defense

00:08:42.889 --> 00:08:43.322
are doing it

00:08:43.322 --> 00:08:44.390
a little prematurely

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:45.191
because we don't know

00:08:45.191 --> 00:08:46.759
what's in the indictment right now.

00:08:46.759 --> 00:08:48.327
And it could be really bad

00:08:48.327 --> 00:08:49.695
for Donald Trump

00:08:49.695 --> 00:08:50.496
or it could be a

00:08:50.496 --> 00:08:51.130
nothing burger,

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:53.566
but if I had to guess my money is on that

00:08:53.599 --> 00:08:55.034
this is a rock solid case,

00:08:55.034 --> 00:08:56.969
I don't think that the special counsel

00:08:56.969 --> 00:08:58.170
would have taken it

00:08:58.170 --> 00:08:59.839
to the point of an indictment

00:08:59.839 --> 00:09:00.740
if it weren't.

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:02.575
Look, and speaking about

00:09:02.575 --> 00:09:05.545
potential premature reaction to

00:09:06.178 --> 00:09:08.548
this indictment just this morning,

00:09:08.548 --> 00:09:09.181
Paula Reid

00:09:09.181 --> 00:09:12.318
and her and the team have reported this

00:09:12.318 --> 00:09:13.786
transcript, quotes

00:09:13.786 --> 00:09:16.322
from the transcript of a conversation

00:09:16.322 --> 00:09:16.889
that Donald Trump

00:09:16.889 --> 00:09:18.291
was having back in 20, 21

00:09:18.291 --> 00:09:19.892
where he says, among other things,

00:09:19.892 --> 00:09:21.360
he's got this document in hand.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:22.495
We've talked about so much

00:09:22.495 --> 00:09:24.163
that he could have classified it.

00:09:24.163 --> 00:09:26.532
But now I can't, acknowledging

00:09:26.532 --> 00:09:27.567
that he still had

00:09:27.567 --> 00:09:29.735
this secret military document,

00:09:29.735 --> 00:09:31.771
military information and saying see

00:09:31.804 --> 00:09:33.372
see look at this.

00:09:33.372 --> 00:09:34.607
When you hear that, Sara,

00:09:34.607 --> 00:09:35.875
what do you think?

00:09:35.942 --> 00:09:37.510
I think it completely undercuts

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:39.345
all of his excuses

00:09:39.345 --> 00:09:40.413
that him and his team

00:09:40.413 --> 00:09:41.347
have been putting out there.

00:09:41.347 --> 00:09:42.081
They've kind of tried

00:09:42.081 --> 00:09:43.983
to use everything under the sun.

00:09:43.983 --> 00:09:45.651
They have said things like, well,

00:09:45.651 --> 00:09:47.853
he declassified them in his mind

00:09:47.853 --> 00:09:50.122
before he left. That's why he took them.

00:09:50.122 --> 00:09:52.158
This just goes to show in this transcript

00:09:52.158 --> 00:09:53.960
that he took these things

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:55.428
that he did not declassify.

00:09:55.428 --> 00:09:56.395
He knew he could have

00:09:56.395 --> 00:09:57.530
while he was president.

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:58.998
And then he showed them to people

00:09:58.998 --> 00:10:00.333
who didn't have the proper clearance.

